      "message": "Per cosmin\u0027s ask, time effect measured:\n\nI picked pro1x as it has 1000+ blobs (the most I have on any device is 1400, with most at or around 1100):\n```\nnolenjohnson@ODS-PROD:~/lineage-23/device/fxtec/pro1x$ wc -l proprietary-files.txt\n1026 proprietary-files.txt\n```\n\nBefore:\n```\nnolenjohnson@ODS-PROD:~/lineage-23/device/fxtec/pro1x$ time ./extract-files.py ~/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nUsing source dump dir /home/nolenjohnson/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nsystem_ext/lib64/lib-imsvideocodec.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/camera.qcom.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/fingerprint.bengal.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/microarray.fingerprint.default.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/libdpps.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/libwvhidl.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/mediadrm/libwvdrmengine.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/vendor.qti.hardware.camera.postproc@1.0-service-impl.so: fixed up\n\nreal    0m0.515s\nuser    0m0.241s\nsys    0m0.270s\n```\n\nAfter:\n```\nnolenjohnson@ODS-PROD:~/lineage-23/device/fxtec/pro1x$ time ./extract-files.py ~/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nUsing source dump dir /home/nolenjohnson/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nsystem_ext/lib64/lib-imsvideocodec.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/camera.qcom.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/fingerprint.bengal.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/microarray.fingerprint.default.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/libdpps.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/libwvhidl.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/mediadrm/libwvdrmengine.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/vendor.qti.hardware.camera.postproc@1.0-service-impl.so: fixed up\n\nreal    0m0.898s\nuser    0m0.624s\nsys    0m0.268s\n```\n\nTo verify functionality, picked this chain of 2 commits + the following manual test change:\n```\nnolenjohnson@ODS-PROD:~/lineage-23/device/fxtec/pro1x$ git diff\ndiff --git a/proprietary-files.txt b/proprietary-files.txt\nindex a1d858067..042628045 100644\n--- a/proprietary-files.txt\n+++ b/proprietary-files.txt\n@@ -1,6 +1,8 @@\n ## All proprietary files from this list, unless pinned and noted otherwise, are\n ## from FxTec Pro1-X Fx_tec_Pro1X/QX1050_2_EEA/QX1050:11/RKQ1.211130.001/eng.leilia.20230417:user/release-keys.\n\n+vendor/etc/useless.lic\n+\n # ACDB\n vendor/etc/acdbdata/IDP/IDP_Bluetooth_cal.acdb\n vendor/etc/acdbdata/IDP/IDP_General_cal.acdb\n```\n\n```\nnolenjohnson@ODS-PROD:~$ cat ~/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/vendor/etc/useless.lic\n############################################################\n# SenseTime License\n[...]\n```\n\nExtract bailing out like it should:\n```\nnolenjohnson@ODS-PROD:~/lineage-23/device/fxtec/pro1x$ time ./extract-files.py ~/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nUsing source dump dir /home/nolenjohnson/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nsystem_ext/lib64/lib-imsvideocodec.so: fixed up\nERROR: Prohibited file detected: vendor/etc/useless.lic\n  Reason: binary signature matched: SenseTime\n\nPolicy violation:\nThe following categories of files are not allowed:\n\n   - Megvii / Face++ related libraries and assets:\n    (e.g. lib*{M,m}eg*.so, lib*{M,m}g*.so, *{M,m}egvii*)\n\n   - SenseTime license artifacts:\n    (e.g. license.lic)\n\nThese files are not permitted in LineageOS repositories/builds.\n\nPlease look for available shims, or develop one to mitigate these dependencies.\n\nTo extract them anyway for a private/local build, re-run with:\n\nextract-files.py --allow-prohibited-files [...]\n\n\nreal    0m0.315s\nuser    0m0.182s\nsys    0m0.121s\n```\n\nUsing `--allow-prohibited-files`:\n```\nnolenjohnson@ODS-PROD:~/lineage-23/device/fxtec/pro1x$ time ./extract-files.py ~/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/ --allow-prohibited-files\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nParsing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nUsing source dump dir /home/nolenjohnson/dumps/fxtec/pro1x/dump/\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-firmware.txt\nProcessing device/fxtec/pro1x/proprietary-files.txt\nsystem_ext/lib64/lib-imsvideocodec.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/camera.qcom.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/fingerprint.bengal.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/hw/microarray.fingerprint.default.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/libdpps.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/libwvhidl.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/mediadrm/libwvdrmengine.so: fixed up\nvendor/lib64/vendor.qti.hardware.camera.postproc@1.0-service-impl.so: fixed up\n\nreal    0m0.500s\nuser    0m0.236s\nsys    0m0.251s\n```",
